    },
    "body": "The current entry documents mix three different model paths, retain a superseded serving contract, and describe a static fitted count predictor as a ceiling for a prefix-dependent recurrent core. This reconciliation records the owner-confirmed D0-b allowance, scopes historical results, and makes causal/instrument correctness plus route coverage the next task before timing and a conditional real-text pilot.\n\nAdds a source/history/literature takeover review and self-contained DeepSeek execution prompt; updates README, roadmap, current state, policy and research navigation. Preserves original receipts and dated reports with explicit corrections. Reorders the prose ledger while leaving the live time balance unchanged and recording unresolved arithmetic/receipt discrepancies. Includes public upstream head metadata with explicit source-review limits.\n\nValidation: `git diff --check`; claim-wording gate; existing release `r4-policy-check`; structured D0-b consistency assertions; 686 local Markdown links; independent source/math review of the investigation and handoff. No Rust code changed, and no build, model run, new capability result or energy measurement was performed. Source-derived learner/instrument defects remain pending the specified next task. Queue status acknowledgements are not tests.\n\nReferences #820, #973, #963, #964, #1139.\n",
